<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9479] Spontaneous rebalance may be triggered after a cache start</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9479</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;As an optimization, we do not run two-phase exchange latch release and do not validate partition counters during cache start.&lt;br/&gt;
This can lead to a situation, when rebalance is mistakenly triggered under load after a cache start.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We should treat cache start event the same way as other exchange events that need counters sync.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13183347">IGNITE-9479</key>
            <summary>Spontaneous rebalance may be triggered after a cache start</summary>
